// =====================================  Corrlorized style  ==================================

// Corrlorized - Main - PoE and Corrlorized - BIG GG - PoE: the look of Erazure-S13-corrlorized.filter (a
// restyle of Season 13's Erazure - Main - PoE, 1a0ae41, by Corr) on today's Erazure - Main - PoE and
// Erazure - BIG GG - PoE (each file has all 8 toggle blocks). Imported with
// python tools/style_edits.py --port (2026-10-19); the author's review (2026-10-20): his look everywhere but the
// Horadric Cube, which names this filter, and the tags (the author's "r", not Corr's "res"); his look on 52 S14
// rules he never saw. Rules are the author's: map resistances and descriptions, rune and gem notifications and
// icons, and tags as in Erazure. Of the displays Corr switched off, only the minimap icons of Small and Grand
// Charms under item level 90 stay off, and since his v2 (2026-10-20) the Highest Resistances of T1-T3 maps (one
// '*' entry per map; their Monster Immunities show, and unique maps keep both). No sounds or minimap icons on
// rare rings, belts and boots, ethereal rare and magic axes, magic jewels and Large Charms, nor on rare circlets
// and amulets on level 12 (Corr's removals, and the author's for boots, the jewels of The Fallen Gardens and The
// Diamond Gate, and level 12's jewelry).
// Each entry: '@ <section file>:<line>  <name>' (where it last matched, kept up to date by the build), then
// '- <the author's line>' and '+ <the style's line>' (only what the rule shows changes; its condition and
// comment stay the author's), '= <anchor line>' and '+ <lines inserted after it>', 'x <a rule switched off>',
// or '* <words>' (each rule of the section whose condition has those words, switched off). See
// tools/style_edits.py.

// == 020-horadric-cube.filter ==
@ 020-horadric-cube.filter:28  Corrlorized on the Cube
- Alias[MAIN_VERSION_NAME]:Erazure - Main
+ Alias[MAIN_VERSION_NAME]:Corrlorized - Main
@ 020-horadric-cube.filter:30  Corrlorized on the Cube
- ItemDisplay[!BIG_GG !POE_SOUNDS REVEALED box]:%NAME%{%NAME%%CL%%TEAL%Erazure - Revealed}%CONTINUE%//
+ ItemDisplay[!BIG_GG !POE_SOUNDS REVEALED box]:%NAME%{%NAME%%CL%%TEAL%Corrlorized - Revealed}%CONTINUE%//
@ 020-horadric-cube.filter:31  Corrlorized on the Cube
