+ ItemDisplay[BIG_GG !POE_SOUNDS REVEALED box]:%NAME%{%NAME%%CL%%TEAL%Corrlorized - Revealed - Big GG}%CONTINUE%//
@ 020-horadric-cube.filter:35  Corrlorized on the Cube
